{
  "title": { "zh": "几条一起" },
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "几条改写规则一起用，每次用对得上的那一条，改到哪一条都对不上为止，这叫<b>化简</b>。规则从板上的「规则」输入进来；设计出的证明助手会成为新元件<part-ref to=\"lemma:simp\"></part-ref>，这个输入就是它的「规则」口。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": { "zh": "Isabelle 和 Lean 的 simp 做的也是这件事。" },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "sp-simp",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "becomes",
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } },
        { "name": "rules", "label": { "zh": "规则" } }
      ],
      "backtrack": true,
      "tests": [
        { "goal": "¬(Rain ∨ ¬Wind)", "rules": ["dneg.elim", "dm.notOr", "dm.notAnd"], "becomes": [["¬Rain ∧ Wind"]] },
        { "goal": "¬¬¬(Rain ∧ Wind)", "rules": ["dneg.elim", "dm.notOr", "dm.notAnd"], "becomes": [["¬Rain ∨ ¬Wind"]] },
        {
          "goal": "¬(¬Rain ∨ ¬¬Wind) ∧ Wet",
          "rules": ["dneg.elim", "dm.notOr", "dm.notAnd"],
          "becomes": [["(Rain ∧ ¬Wind) ∧ Wet"]]
        },
        { "goal": "Rain ∧ Wet", "rules": ["dneg.elim", "dm.notOr", "dm.notAnd"], "becomes": [["Rain ∧ Wet"]] }
      ],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "设计一个证明助手，用「规则」输入的改写规则把每个目标一直改下去，直到哪一条都对不上。"
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "和<level-ref to=\"sp-repeat\"></level-ref>一样，要改到改不动为止。"
        },
        {
          "zh": "<part-ref to=\"part:rw\"></part-ref>也能接一串规则，用其中第一条对得上的。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": ["c0 = repeat(in, body: c1) {", "  body {", "    c1 = rw(c0.body, rules)", "  }", "}", "out <- c0"]
    }
  ]
}
